; Mixed-case block names, the shape a real survey file takes when the
; surveyor names blocks after a cave code (48H-Feng). A Scope trip stores
; its stationPrefix with this authored spelling while cavern lowercases
; every label it writes to the .3d, so this fixture is the case-matching
; regression that survex_blocks.svx (all lowercase) cannot catch.
;   48H-Feng          F1, F2 (+ the tie into the child block)
;   48H-Feng.Lower    L1, L2
; *fix F1 plus the cross-block tie keep the file one connected component,
; so cavern solves it. Hand-computable: length 19 m, depth 4 m.
*begin 48H-Feng
*fix F1 0 0 0
*data normal from to tape compass clino
F1 F2 10.0 0 0
F2 Lower.L1 5.0 90 0

*begin Lower
L1 L2 4.0 0 -90
*end Lower
*end 48H-Feng
